h1>
<h1 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"col=
or: #192733;">Meet the cowboy who never clocks out</span></h1>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"color: #192733=
;"><em>Livestock on the loose? Call this guy</em></span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold"><br><span s=
tyle=3D"color: #192733;">BY <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB=
+113/d2q-Vf04/VWWlx93_TrpzVc1ZGd2pZ_zmW5tZZwQ5HVz2DN2NZZ2z2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3k=
SW4lW09w4z0xHHW5Dq1pC4bCWRqW4yYFzW5h2tzFW8HLF1N7BZ-BsW4XmBDq4gF2ZyW2x0Jpw79=
r51fW4kfGrG4TgDmWW34ddfN7yMq1_W779RC53t4lftW79yX985q5-VpW83k4F77bZ3M_W87WrX=
T6ZbsJ1W7jZqWj5lG1xkW2QxwJy9gQr2dW2_3fvX9cVcJTW40GMl02xYHv_f9fYGXz04" style=
=3D"font-weight:bold; color:#192733; text-decoration:none !important" rel=
=3D"noopener" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"oE73l/qS" target=
=3D"_blank">KATHERINE LAIDLAW</a></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">One summer, early on in his career, Illinois =
cattle catcher <strong>Wesley Bush</strong> got a call from down in Tenness=
ee. He=E2=80=99d just taken over the business full-time from an old hand ca=
ttle herder, and he was still finding his own footing.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The guy explained that, eight years ago, he=
=E2=80=99d bought a piece of property knowing it came with a herd of cattle=
 that roamed wild. But now he wanted to sell, and the prospective buyer had=
 a stipulation: he needed to deal with the runaway cattle problem. He=E2=80=
=99d hired several other people to come round them up, but no one could get=
 the job done.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Bush loaded up his Dodge Ram one-ton pickup a=
nd hit the road. He traveled alone, just him, his dogs, and his horse behin=
d him in a trailer. =E2=80=9CBuddy, this ain=E2=80=99t Illinois. These are =
the mountains in Tennessee,=E2=80=9D his client told him.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CI called up a friend in Kentucky, he=
 met me there,=E2=80=9D Bush says. =E2=80=9CWe were done by 1 o=E2=80=99clo=
ck.=E2=80=9D</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<div id=3D"hs_cos_wrapper_module-2-0-1" class=3D"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrap=
