        <img alt=3D"Cowboy on Assignment: A man in a blue shirt and cowboy =
hat rides a brown horse through a grassy, rolling field toward a line of tr=
ees." src=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/hs-fs/hubfs/Daily%20Newsletter%20Ima=
ges/Daily%20Images/Jan%204%202025/cowboy-wesley2.jpg?width=3D1160&amp;upsca=
le=3Dtrue&amp;name=3Dcowboy-wesley2.jpg" style=3D"outline:none; text-decora=
