e=3D"rich_text"><p style=3D"line-height:125%"><span style=3D"color: #192733=
;"><em><span style=3D"font-size: 12px;">Wesley Bush on assignment. (Faceboo=
k)</span></em></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Bush is one of America=E2=80=99s few remainin=
g on-call cowboys. He=E2=80=99s traveled as far south as Tennessee, across =
Ohio and Kentucky, and north to Minnesota and Michigan, all in the name of =
catching cattle. He=E2=80=99s on call 24 hours a day, seven days a week.</p=
>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; line-height:125%; font-size:18px">Horsing around</h2=
>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Born and raised in Morrison, Illinois, Bush a=
lways imagined he=E2=80=99d work with horses. At 13, he expressed interest =
in learning to rope. He spent a few years training his roping arm and compe=
ting in the rodeo.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CI could catch cattle for friends and=
 neighbors who needed help, as long as they were visible, in pasture,=E2=80=
=9D he says. =E2=80=9CDuring the summer, if they were in the corn, I wasn=
=E2=80=99t any help.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">If the job required figuring out where the ca=
ttle had gone, they had to call <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ct=
c/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWWlx93_TrpzVc1ZGd2pZ_zmW5tZZwQ5HVz2DN2NZZ2T2-ZW0W5BW0B06=
lZ3phW6RPSq85CYV9BW1_BHd81V6NC9W8p14FS4D4ZtWW6VDf0m44Lyp3W1WNzJw1xhyW5W7vR7=
RN5QVCbNW80TKGK2w2fprW87bJHp7Qdf5sW18-2_R7wZmwtN1SZZ3Y_H10RN8b6v5HGYwyBW1Fp=
mr-2Hc2Z2W6C7dzG1rZlgLW4zHnNb7f_mMrW1FPPn34BM-1bW3CHrxD74mvq4W60Dp6X7QRg8JW=
68f4d_69VR0rf71SScY04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-h=
s-link-id-v2=3D"aadnPtWp" target=3D"_blank">Chet Peugh</a>, a local man in =
the next town over running a second-generation cattle-catching business.</p=
></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
