<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The second was a team of dogs trained to trac=
k and find cattle, thicket of corn stalks be damned. (The job comes with a =
special kind of R&amp;D: Bush now breeds his own dogs =E2=80=93 part cataho=
ula, terrier, and hound =E2=80=93 to ensure he=E2=80=99s working with an ex=
pert team of trackers.)</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The dogs join Bush on his cattle calls, and i=
f they can catch a fresh scent, they point him in the right direction. From=
 there, it=E2=80=99s a matter of rounding them up. Usually, he says, a drov=
e on the run will split into groups of 15 or less.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; line-height:125%; font-size:18px">Cost per head</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Cattle ranchers and farmers in the US aren=E2=
=80=99t having the best time. For one, the herd size is constricting: last =
year, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWWlx93_=
TrpzVc1ZGd2pZ_zmW5tZZwQ5HVz2DN2NZZ3s2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3ltW7Lsr953CNxVpW10H_z41=
QRBJXW1hYVWb7ZhzQ0W1N7sqZ3LT3BbW6Wwq8c2Ps74bW70X-104_5JFJW91JrHy47C9T-W1j38=
595KmyJ-W6b57Y621_LDZW3YcN_V6Js5LmW5NHV2G2429RRW8Y3K1_2HN55bW3vL9wD6WF_7pW3=
sKswS5zMmgsW8zXqhK2bNP4WW79cvVr5X4Vy_N1FWDcVQ9ypnW2lTyZK56nz65W3YKtRK2vSQ1T=
W7y_BWk8gPwfdW4w7CYf3w8Bg_W7JZ5rr6Jx3VFdqjbbx04" style=3D"color:#192733" da=
ta-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"gAJfDeQo" target=3D"_blank">it hi=
t its lowest point</a> since 1951. Production costs are up, reaching record=
 highs, and tariffs have squeezed supplies like fertilizer, pesticides, and=
 tractors and other self-propelled machinery.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Dairy farmers are even testing out new revenu=
e streams, like <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf0=
4/VWWlx93_TrpzVc1ZGd2pZ_zmW5tZZwQ5HVz2DN2NZZ3s2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3mbW3Mzblf62Nr=
ykN311jQ3KtdTJW6Qg0Hn3rBVZBW1sZBYH6jK1XCW90Bn5w3yjrp0W2jnHVQ6wN1-lW6nG6d_97=
jZ1xW2zYFMF27Ws6YN26mrm399Gs4W2BsxCs6D3mn8W64_RlQ2nRFHSW1bCVW12vmWFNW4M5JpP=
2pLjCQW2CnXhj8Z9FZjW8y5hw-1s6-fnW31zPsR3hlBG6W4F5NzM5pVV53N78zvDGlB_TyW75FT=
Gw6lzwLHW1X-ZZG2cFH3fW3BC219129CZtV7TPHq31fgNqddLc1q04" style=3D"color:#192=
733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"m8i7Z9xY" target=3D"_blank=
">cow cuddling</a>, to boost a year where prices and demand for dairy have =
fallen. (Surprised? Bookings for the experience at <a  href=3D"https://medi=
a.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWWlx93_TrpzVc1ZGd2pZ_zmW5tZZwQ5HVz2D=
N2NZZ3s2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3mVW2r681D4-MPtPW2thSR33yBF-DW3DnFcj5GzBNDVcX3Zh31JxY=
7W45KT_x6Gm3Z5W1VPfnF59B91HW33YsN81kGZjdN2pJCdWJQ1z0W79zmGL2PM2X_W3d32Ms1yq=
ndZN207Pf3KHn3xW143tCg4YBg34W7_sY0l1DdQSjVBQQDj8SqlRMW82JnjZ514xHjW5-1kJb7l=
WcpdN10xQz1v5YkYW212Sl44-JkGCW6MMsSf6zgyRJVb9FB-2qtpJsW7kJ57q7jMfv7N7gPHMFh=
pnZCf1ZT00C04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-i=
d-v2=3D"bP3ImLSR" target=3D"_blank">one Washington County, Penn., farm</a> =
went from ~500 to 2.5k+ last year.)</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Bush=E2=80=99s pricing follows the market. He=
 quotes his clients a standard fee =E2=80=93 by the head =E2=80=93 and a mi=
leage fee to account for his travel.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CDuring Covid, cattle prices dropped =
drastically and I dropped my prices,=E2=80=9D he says. =E2=80=9CI currently=
 get about $400 a head on them.=E2=80=9D</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody><=
/table>
