ype=3D"rich_text"><p style=3D"line-height:125%"><span style=3D"color: #1927=
33;"><em><span style=3D"font-size: 12px;">Olivia Heller/The Hustle</span></=
em></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">And while the job itself comes with some risk=
s (Bush=E2=80=99s list of injuries starts with a broken leg and ends with a=
 shattered shoulder blade), he says there=E2=80=99s nothing quite like hear=
ing that satisfying click of the gate and helping someone out of a stressfu=
l situation.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CWhen somebody=E2=80=99s cattle are o=
ut, it=E2=80=99s a huge liability for them, a very stressful time,=E2=80=9D=
 he says.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CThe best part of the job is when you=
 can get the job done for somebody and they can relax.=E2=80=9D</p></div></=
div></td></tr></tbody></table>
</div>
